        {
            "section": "why-intelliworkz",
            "section_label": "Why Intelliworkz",
            "key": "why-intelliworkz.2",
            "label": "Paragraph: Most presentations fail for the same reason: …",
            "type": "textarea",
            "value": "Most presentations fail for the same reason: there is too much on every slide, and no clear point for the audience to follow. The information is all there, but it is buried under long bullet lists, dense text, and charts that are hard to read. The audience ends up reading the slide instead of listening to you. We fix this by designing around your message first, then making each slide simple to read and simple to present from.",
            "sort": 25
        },
        {
            "section": "why-intelliworkz",
            "section_label": "Why Intelliworkz",
            "key": "why-intelliworkz.3",
            "label": "Paragraph: We start with your content and your goal, whe…",
            "type": "textarea",
            "value": "We start with your content and your goal, whether that is winning an investment, closing a sale, or bringing a team together. We then put the story in a clear order, cut each slide down to the one point it needs to make, and design it to match your brand. Dense data becomes simple charts, heavy text becomes short and clear lines, and the deck is easy for an audience to follow.",
            "sort": 26
        },
        {
            "section": "why-intelliworkz",
            "section_label": "Why Intelliworkz",
            "key": "why-intelliworkz.4",
            "label": "Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…",
            "type": "textarea",
            "value": "As a branding partner, we also make sure your presentation matches the rest of your business. The colours, fonts and style follow your brand, so every deck looks like it belongs to your company.",
