            "key": "ppt_faqs",
            "scope": "ppt-design",
            "items": [
                [
                    "What is included in your PPT design services?",
                    "Content structuring, slide design, custom icons, charts and data visuals, and a finished deck built to your brand. We can also build a reusable template. You always receive fully editable files, and you can bring us raw content, a draft, or an existing deck to rebuild."
                ],
                [
                    "In which file formats do you deliver the presentation?",
                    "We hand over fully editable files, ready to present. We work in Microsoft PowerPoint, Google Slides and Apple Keynote, and can also deliver a reusable template."
                ],
                [
                    "Is it safe to outsource confidential presentation content?",
                    "Yes. Your presentation content, financial information and unpublished business material stay confidential within our in-house team, with no freelancers or subcontracting."
                ],
                [
                    "What types of PowerPoint presentations do you design?",
                    "Sales and pitch presentations, company profiles and capability decks, product and service presentations, proposal and tender decks, investor decks, business reports, and templates for internal use."
                ],
                [
                    "Can I outsource PowerPoint design to your team?",
                    "Yes. You can hand us raw content, a rough draft, a Word document, or an old deck that needs rebuilding, and we turn it into a finished, professional presentation."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you design pitch decks and investor presentations?",
                    "Yes. We design high-stakes pitches that have to win in one meeting: the story in a clear order, each slide cut down to the one point it needs to make, and the design matched to your brand."
                ]
